OL,3,GNEWSADispersal order brought in after
OL,4,Aeight arrests
OL,5,
OL,6,FEight teenagers have been arrested and
OL,7,Fa dispersal order has been put in place
OL,8,Fin Chatham and Rochester following
OL,9,Fanti-social behaviour in the two Medway
OL,10,Ftowns.
OL,12,FKent Police said the arrests followed a
OL,13,Fdisturbance involving a large number of
OL,14,Fyoung people in Chatham High Street at
OL,15,Fabout 16:25 BST on 8 October.
OL,17,FThe dispersal order this weekend covers
OL,18,FChatham and Rochester town centres,
OL,19,Fincluding Fort Pitt Gardens, Jackson's
OL,20,FField and Victoria Gardens. It will be
OL,21,Fin place until 11:15 BST on Sunday.
OL,23,APub: 17-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
